    ".*": {},
    "A %@ was interrupted": {},
    "A Space has its own folders, documents, tags and tasks.": {},
    "A color was darkened or lightened so the text stays readable (4.5:1).": {},
    "A copy becomes a template in New → From Template. Later edits to either don't change the other.": {},
    "A free, open-source, local-first notes app. No account and no telemetry; nothing goes online unless you turn on image search, link previews, the Assistant's model download, or the optional OpenAI Assistant (after you review what it will send).": {},
    "A new day starts at": {},
    "A note's id doesn't match its file name": {},
    "A private assistant for your notes": {},
    "A quiet place to write. Your notes live on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klidné místo k psaní. Vaše poznámky zůstávají v tomto Macu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein ruhiger Ort zum Schreiben. Deine Notizen bleiben auf diesem Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small local model reads only the context you choose: a selection, the open document (very long ones are cut to what fits), or the most relevant blocks of this Space. It can misread notes or be wrong; check answers against the sources it shows.": {},
