    "Draft": {},
    "Draft 0.6": {},
    "Draft can summarize, explain and rewrite your notes, and answer questions about them, with a language model that runs entirely on this Mac. No account, no subscription, and your notes are never sent anywhere.": {},
    "Draft can't import “%@”.": {},
    "Draft can't open your notes safely": {},
    "Draft copies every file before it updates its format. Rolling back puts those copies back (after backing up the current files) and opens the vault read-only so it isn't updated again.": {},
    "Draft copies the vault to a temporary folder, updates the copy to this version's format, reads it back and compares every note, title, block id and link. The real vault is never touched.": {},
    "Draft found a problem before opening your notes": {},
    "Draft keeps the newest %lld automatic versions of each note (one every 10 minutes while you edit) plus every version you save yourself; notes stay in Recently Deleted for %lld days. Other backups stay until you remove them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Draft keeps the newest %1$lld automatic versions of each note (one every 10 minutes while you edit) plus every version you save yourself; notes stay in Recently Deleted for %2$lld days. Other backups stay until you remove them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draft saves a version every 10 minutes while you edit. Use Save Version Now to keep this one.": {},
    "Draft will send “%@” to api.openverse.org and load image previews from it. Nothing else is sent.": {},
    "Draft works fully offline. These send your search words or the pasted address to that website, only when you use them.": {},
    "Drag the frame to reposition, the corner to resize. Arrow keys move it in small steps.": {},
